Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.20,0:00:03.68,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,WHITE RABBIT: Oh, dear! Oh, dear! I shall be too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.03,0:00:14.19,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: A rabbit wearing a waistcoat and carrying a watch? How curious! Oh wait! Mr. Rabbit! Where are you going? What's the hurry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.54,0:00:17.26,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,WHITE RABBIT: The Queen will be furious if I don't reach the palace!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:23.48,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,CHESHIRE CAT: Welcome to Wonderland, little girl! Looking for someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.83,0:00:25.43,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: I'm looking for my way home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.78,0:00:29.94,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,CHESHIRE CAT: That depends on where you want to go! We're all mad here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.29,0:00:32.69,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: Everybody seems so strange here!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:35.12,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,CHESHIRE CAT: Follow the music to the tea party!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.82,0:00:41.66,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,DORMOUSE: Twinkle, twinkle, little bat...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:45.67,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,MAD HATTER: No room! No room! Welcome to our tea party!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.02,0:00:47.62,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: But there's plenty of room!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.97,0:00:51.73,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,MARCH HARE: Have some tea! Or perhaps some imaginary wine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.08,0:00:54.40,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: Why is this tea party so strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.75,0:00:57.95,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,MAD HATTER: Because in Wonderland, nothing makes sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.30,0:01:02.46,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,DORMOUSE: Please stop! I'm trying to sleep!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.81,0:01:04.25,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: Don't you ever wake up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:07.48,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,DORMOUSE: Only when someone mentions cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.83,0:01:09.91,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,MARCH HARE: Wake up, Dormouse! It's tea time!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.26,0:01:12.50,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,DORMOUSE: Oh! Then I'm wide awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.20,0:01:19.04,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,RED QUEEN: Who dares enter my garden? Off with their heads!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.39,0:01:20.75,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: Why are you so angry?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.10,0:01:23.50,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,RED QUEEN: How dare you question the Queen of Hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.85,0:01:27.77,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,CARD SOLDIER: Yes, Your Majesty! Nobody questions the Queen of Hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.12,0:01:30.68,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: Do you always follow orders without thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.03,0:01:33.19,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,CARD SOLDIER: Well, I'm a soldier, not a thinker!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.54,0:01:36.18,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,RED QUEEN: Enough talking! Seize her immediately!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.53,0:01:38.05,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,CARD SOLDIER: Yes, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:42.40,StageSafeTop,,0,0,0,,ALICE: I'm not afraid of you! You're nothing but a pack of cards!